WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:01.966
(applause)

00:00:01.966 --> 00:00:04.670
- And that's not the only cool thing

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.293
we have exclusively for Comic-Con,

00:00:06.293 --> 00:00:08.645
this week we are broadcasting
our shows in virtual reality,

00:00:08.645 --> 00:00:11.229
thanks to our good friends at AT&amp;T.

00:00:11.229 --> 00:00:12.062
That's right.

00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:14.981
You can watch our show in VR,

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.816
via Conan Cardboard and other VR devices,

00:00:17.816 --> 00:00:22.413
we have four Conan 360 cameras
placed all over this theater,

00:00:22.413 --> 00:00:24.469
you can see the show from any angle.

00:00:24.469 --> 00:00:26.197
It's pretty impressive, show 'em Andy!

00:00:26.197 --> 00:00:28.463
- [Andy] All right, strapping in.

00:00:28.463 --> 00:00:29.296
- All right.

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:30.833
(laughter)

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.666
- [Andy] All right, let's take it,

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:32.837
oh, hi Conan.

00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:34.058
- Yeah, hey Andy, how's it going?

00:00:34.058 --> 00:00:34.901
- [Andy] I see you got our,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.637
oh, look at how big you look.

00:00:36.637 --> 00:00:37.470
- Yeah.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.437
(audience laughs)

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:40.141
- [Andy] All right, let's
cycle through the cameras first

00:00:40.141 --> 00:00:41.138
so people can see.

00:00:41.138 --> 00:00:42.061
- [Conan] That's pretty impressive.

00:00:42.061 --> 00:00:42.925
- [Andy] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:44.525
Okay, there it is.

00:00:44.525 --> 00:00:45.774
Get a little vertigo going.

00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:47.073
(audience applauds)

00:00:47.073 --> 00:00:48.498
Whoa, oh yeah.

00:00:48.498 --> 00:00:50.975
Now there's a good wave.

00:00:50.975 --> 00:00:51.808
Hey buddy.

00:00:52.921 --> 00:00:54.626
What's going on, pal?

00:00:54.626 --> 00:00:56.684
(laughter)

00:00:56.684 --> 00:00:58.096
Hey guy, how you doing?

00:00:58.096 --> 00:00:59.936
- [Conan] Refuses to
acknowledge you in any way.

00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:00.769
(audience laughs)

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:01.602
- [Andy] What's going on, buddy?

00:01:01.602 --> 00:01:02.899
- [Conan] Nope, refuses to
acknowledge you in any way.

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:04.440
- [Andy] Yeah, yeah, hi friend.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.273
- [Conan] Yeah.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:06.240
- [Andy] What's your name, buddy?

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.256
- [Conan] Very nice.

00:01:07.256 --> 00:01:10.187
(audience laughs)

00:01:10.187 --> 00:01:12.360
Clearly someone is fleeing
the long arm of the law.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.704
- [Andy] Someone's a little shy.

00:01:13.704 --> 00:01:16.080
Wait, go back to the other
one because I want to get.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.458
- [Conan] Oh, look at that!

00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:18.503
(audience applauds)

00:01:18.503 --> 00:01:19.980
- [Andy] Oh, there's me.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.880
- [Conan] Wow.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:22.756
Yeah.

00:01:22.756 --> 00:01:23.708
- [Andy] I could lose a few.

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:24.541
(audience applauds)

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:27.480
Well, this is what you get to do at home.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.313
Oh hi!

00:01:30.445 --> 00:01:32.051
You brought your luggage.

00:01:32.051 --> 00:01:33.061
(audience laughs)

00:01:33.061 --> 00:01:33.901
- [Conan] Okay.

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:34.917
Andy you look like an idiot.

00:01:34.917 --> 00:01:36.959
(laughs)

00:01:36.959 --> 00:01:38.716
- [Andy] I do!

00:01:38.716 --> 00:01:40.693
Oh my God, I just saw myself, I do!

00:01:40.693 --> 00:01:41.526
- [Conan] Yeah,

00:01:41.526 --> 00:01:43.309
it's as if you're in the
actual theater, Andy.

00:01:43.309 --> 00:01:44.501
- [Andy] It really is.

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:45.453
(audience laughs)

00:01:45.453 --> 00:01:47.846
It's so much more real
than actually being here.

00:01:47.846 --> 00:01:48.799
- [Conan] Yeah, uh.

00:01:48.799 --> 00:01:49.965
(audience laughs)

00:01:49.965 --> 00:01:51.469
Now, those of you at home with headsets

00:01:51.469 --> 00:01:53.395
can go to teamcoco.com/360

00:01:53.395 --> 00:01:55.485
to experience all of this if you like.

00:01:55.485 --> 00:01:58.581
Thanks for our friends at
AT&amp;T for sponsoring Conan 360,

00:01:58.581 --> 00:01:59.645
we're going to take a quick break,

00:01:59.645 --> 00:02:00.492
when we come back,

00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:02.109
the cast of Silicon Valley!

00:02:02.109 --> 00:02:04.045
(audience applauds)

00:02:04.045 --> 00:02:06.795
(big band music)

